Cra: a tab closed in Cra runs its page's beforeunload, pagehide and unload, as
Chrome's ⌘W does (TabStripModel::CloseWebContentsAt), but never asks "Leave
site?", as Arc never does. Discord takes its sign-in token out of localStorage
while it thinks DevTools are open (outerWidth - innerWidth > 160, which Cra's
sidebar is) and writes it back on beforeunload; Cra's old forced close skipped
it and signed Discord out on every close (GitHub #705). The bridge marks the
pages it closes (cra::g_closing_without_asking), and their "Leave site?" is
answered "Leave" without showing.

diff --git a/components/javascript_dialogs/app_modal_dialog_manager.cc b/components/javascript_dialogs/app_modal_dialog_manager.cc
--- a/components/javascript_dialogs/app_modal_dialog_manager.cc
+++ b/components/javascript_dialogs/app_modal_dialog_manager.cc
